# Battle of La Albarrada

}}
The Battle of La Albarrada took place on 24 December 1859 in La Albarrada, at the time a colony of the city of Colima (in the state of Colima, Mexico), between elements of the liberal army during the War of Reform. The conservative side under General Miguel Miramón decisively defeated the Juarist (liberal) forces, despite being outnumbered.
